WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.293
Hit Option Shift F. Grab the area you want to give feedback on.

00:05.493 --> 00:10.301
Click to drop a red dot on each issue. Then say what should change.

00:11.051 --> 00:13.976
Then grab the next screen, and the next.

00:14.176 --> 00:19.137
Circles, boxes, arrows, notes. One round holds it all.
